# IMPORTANT: Gmail App Password Setup Instructions
# ---------------------------------------------
# 1. Go to Google Account settings: https://myaccount.google.com/
# 2. Security → 2-Step Verification (must be enabled first)
# 3. App passwords → Generate app password for "Mail"
# 4. Replace 'your-gmail-app-password' above with the 16-character password
# 5. Change MAIL_MAILER from 'log' to 'smtp' when ready for production
# 6. For production, also set MAIL_ENCRYPTION=tls